{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38658","headline":"阳羡杂咏十九首 茗坡 · 陆希声","name":"阳羡杂咏十九首 茗坡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二月山家谷雨天，半坡芳茗露华鲜。\n春醒酒病兼消渴，惜取新芽旋摘煎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆希声","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38658.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38658","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}